      "message": "Oh, I see! That makes sense but let\u0027s make it explicit that not all errors are OK, though.\n\nFor example, assuming that `nop_property()` returns `FdtError::NotFound`, you could\n```\nmatch node.nop_property(prop) {\n    Err(FdtError::NotFound) \u003d\u003e {},\n    result \u003d\u003e result?,\n}\n```",
